sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant API as Chat API
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant A as CustomerCareAgent
  participant G as ToolGateway
  participant O as OCS adapter
  C->>API: What is my balance? (session token)
  API->>S: process_turn
  S->>S: classify intent ACCOUNT_SERVICE
  S->>A: handle
  A->>G: usage.get_balance
  G->>G: scope, policy, args check
  G->>O: get_balance(subscriber)
  O-->>G: balance, validity, data left
  G-->>A: OK + data
  A-->>S: message built from tool result
  S->>S: guardrails check numbers against result
  S-->>C: Balance, validity and data remaining (source: OCS sandbox)
